  "notes": [
    "The Base leg landed 62 s before the Ethereum transaction the old record anchored on, so it is the anchor; its three Elastic pools are immutable factory CREATE2 deployments and the newest sets the age. The other chains' legs are the same campaign (rule 4).",
    "Campaign: the primary exploiter's 30 successful attack-contract calls on Base, Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon and Avalanche. Mimicking bots (reported $6.56M) are not enumerated, so the loss is a lower bound.",
    "Bridged wstETH, KNC and ELK lack DefiLlama history on their chains and are valued at the CoinGecko price of the same asset at the exploit hour."
